{
  "description": "The creature is a standing quadruped shown in right-facing profile against a plain light background, combining the body of a fox with the wings and chest plumage of an owl. It has reddish-brown fox fur over most of the body, with white on the muzzle and lower chest and darker brown to blackish fur on the lower legs, and a long, thick, bushy fox tail extending from the rear. The chest, shoulders, and sides are covered in dense overlapping feathers mottled in brown, tan, grey and white with dark spots and barring, and two large folded feathered wings lie along either side of the torso. The head is fox-like with a pointed muzzle, black nose, whiskers, and brown eyes, giving the overall impression of a fox body bearing owl feathering and wings.",
  "parts": [
    {
      "part": "head",
      "looks_like": "fox-like head with reddish-brown fur, white fur on the muzzle and chin, a black nose at the tip of a pointed snout, brown eyes, and fine whiskers on the muzzle",
      "where": "at the front and top of the body, held upright on the neck and facing to the right"
    },
    {
      "part": "ears",
      "looks_like": "two large, pointed, upright triangular ears with reddish-brown outer fur and dark brown to black interior fur, with lighter edges",
      "where": "on top of the head, one more forward and one slightly behind"
    },
    {
      "part": "mane",
      "looks_like": "thick, shaggy ruff of long reddish-orange fur",
      "where": "around the back and sides of the neck extending down to the upper chest"
    },
    {
      "part": "legs",
      "looks_like": "four slender, straight legs covered in reddish-brown fur that darkens to dark brown and black toward the bottom, with visible musculature",
      "where": "beneath the torso, two forelegs under the chest and two hind legs under the belly and hips"
    },
    {
      "part": "feet",
      "looks_like": "four rounded paws with brown fur, dark claws and visible toe pads",
      "where": "at the bottom ends of each leg, in contact with the ground"
    },
    {
      "part": "tail",
      "looks_like": "long, thick, bushy tail covered in dense reddish-brown fur with a lighter, off-white tip and darker undertones",
      "where": "extending backward and slightly downward from the rear of the body"
    },
    {
      "part": "wings",
      "looks_like": "two large, folded wings with layered flight feathers patterned in tan, brown, grey and white with black spots and dark barring on the primaries",
      "where": "attached at the shoulder region on either side of the torso, lying along the sides of the body with the left wing more fully visible in profile"
    },
    {
      "part": "feathers",
      "looks_like": "dense, overlapping, scale-like feathers in mottled brown, tan, grey and white with small dark spots and white central streaks, covering the chest and shoulder area and continuing onto the wings",
      "where": "covering the entire chest, the front of the shoulders, and the surfaces of both wings"
    },
    {
      "part": "markings",
      "looks_like": "mottled and barred plumage pattern with dark brown spots, black bars on the wing feathers, and white patches on the chest and wing edges, contrasted with the solid reddish-brown fox fur on the head, back, legs and tail",
      "where": "on the feathered chest, shoulders and wings, with fur color contrast on the head, neck, back, legs and tail"
    }
  ],
